<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Falcon Products and Veritas DGC.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Falcon Products and Veritas DGC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Falcon Products Inc and Veritas DGC Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Corimon SACA were also unavailable.</p>
</text>
